The top-right area

At the top-right corner of every page, you will find controls and information.

The Language field lets you switch between Portuguese, English, and Spanish. Select one and the page reloads in that language.

The Break field sets the interval between rest reminders, from 15 to 60 minutes. When the time is up, a message appears suggesting you rest, drink water, or eat something. Click I am back to schedule the next reminder.

The Date format field shows a list of calendars. Select one to see the dates in the texts converted to that calendar. You can choose Gregorian, Hebrew, Hispanic, Islamic, Julian, Mesoamerican, and more.

The Latest addition box shows the most recently published content. Click the name to open it directly.

Below these fields you will find the project social media channels. Click the icons to follow History Tracers and support the project.

Use these controls to customize the site to your preferences.
